      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "A. On October 23, 1961 in Executive Order No. 97, I established an Administrative Board for Blood Credits to study the need for a coordinated City-wide Blood Credit Program to provide for the blood requirements of City employees and their families which would be consistent with the health and welfare of the whole community.",
